WEBVTT

00:00.400 --> 00:02.300
You know this button… too well!

00:03.600 --> 00:06.300
To switch, you sign out. Then sign in again.

00:07.200 --> 00:09.000
Sign out. Sign in again.

00:10.050 --> 00:11.800
You lose your open chats.

00:12.700 --> 00:14.000
Meet aidentity.

00:15.000 --> 00:17.400
Every account you use. Open at once.

00:18.100 --> 00:20.800
Each in its own window. Each one signed in.

00:22.100 --> 00:23.800
Set it up with one command.

00:24.800 --> 00:26.900
No copies. No signing out.

00:27.500 --> 00:29.700
aidentity. Free, for your Mac.
